// ============================================================================
//  v1.99.21 - THE SEVEN `.gsc` DECLARATIONS THAT WERE HERE ARE GONE ON PURPOSE.
//
//  They were:  zm_expanded.gsc  +  the six zm_<map>/zm_<map>.gsc
//
//  This file is GENERATED (build_ff.bat regen) and normally must not be
//  hand-edited - so the regen step now strips `script,*.gsc` lines itself and
//  cannot put these back. Do not "restore" them.
//
//  WHY. A .gsc declared in a zone is shipped inside mod.ff as raw text and the
//  game will run it. console_zm.log records the source of every script, and it
//  is unambiguous:
//        scripts/zm/zm_expanded.gsc      loaded successfully from fastfile
//        scripts/zm/zm_expanded.gsc      (mod (source)): 0x6B419E9F
//        GSC Executed "scripts/zm/zm_expanded::main()"
//        GSC Executed "scripts/zm/zm_expanded::init()"
//  zm_expanded.gsc is the PRE-MERGE module that became quality_of_life.gsc and
//  was deleted from the project months ago. It has no file on disk, so nothing
//  shadowed it, and the Linker kept resolving it from the donor fastfile - so
//  every build re-shipped July's copy and every map ran it, in full, alongside
//  the current script. It cost four replaceFunc collisions at every map load:
//        perks_register_clientfield · init_client_flags · give_perk ·
//        default_vending_precaching
//
//  The other six were harmless but were the same trap one step from springing:
//  the log shows each of them `loaded successfully from raw`, i.e. mod.iwd's
//  current copy wins while a file of that name exists on disk. Rename or delete
//  one and its day-one copy in here comes silently alive, exactly as
//  zm_expanded did. Twelve of the thirteen shipped .gsc were measurably stale.
//
//  🛑 EVERY `.csc` ABOVE STAYS. Client scripts DO load from the fastfile - the
//  same log shows `_zm_weap_freezegun.csc ... from fastfile` - and build_ff.bat
//  stages the current sources over them so they are not stale.
// ============================================================================
