// ============================================================================
//  v2.10.11 - THE PARALYZER'S CAMO, THE LAST GUN IN THE GAME WITHOUT AN
//  ANIMATED PACK-A-PUNCH CAMO.  User, 2026-09-02: "paralyzer is missing
//  animated pap camo, make sure every gun in the game has animated pap camos".
//
//  Measured, not assumed. Every camo asset in all six zombies fastfiles was
//  dumped (Unlinker --include-assets camo) and its index-40 slot read:
//      mod.ff's own 74 camos ......... 74 / 74 carry mc/mtl_weapon_camo_zmb_dlc2
//      zm_transit / zm_highrise /
//      zm_prison / zm_nuked / zm_tomb  every map-owned camo already animated
//      zm_buried ..................... camo_slowgun ALONE has no override at
//                                      that slot - the Paralyzer, and nothing
//                                      else in the game.
//  That is why quality_of_life::get_pack_a_punch_weapon_options carried a
//  slowgun exception pinning it to camo 39: index 40 on the map's own copy
//  resolves to a slot with no camo material at all.
//
//  This declaration makes mod.ff own the asset, and the raw JSON beside it
//  (zone_assets/camo/camo_slowgun.json) is retail's copy with ONE slot
//  changed - index 40 now
//  overrides mc/mtl_t6_wpn_zmb_slowgun with mc/mtl_weapon_camo_zmb_dlc2, at
//  Treyarch's own scale for this gun (shaderConsts 3,3,0,0 and the same map
//  flags, copied from the zombies-camo slot they authored for it). The body
//  material only - the chain and the two glow materials are left alone,
//  exactly as Treyarch's own camo slot for this weapon does.
//
//  The weapon defs are NOT declared here: slowgun_zm stays the map's own.
//  Only the camo changes hands.
// ============================================================================
camo,camo_slowgun
